      "mergedPostDetails": "- The problem\n\nThe window that reads \"Welcome back to VRChat. Logging in as [username]\" seem to be constantly floating in the world upon booting the game. This happens often in both Flat Screen mode and in VR. It also reposition itself to be in-front of me anytime the Launch pad is opened. The problem persist upon joining any other instance/world as well. As soon as I load in it's there again, floating in-front of me.\n\n- Workaround\n\nThe only workaround is simply Re-launching the game 'till it doesn't happen or just looking in a different direction while opening the Launch pad so it doesn't stay floating in an obstructive position.",
